"ADAPTIVE CAMO","u_camo","After 1s still (0.5s at rank 2), distant enemies can\'t start attacks on you. Firing reveals you briefly.","COUNTER-BATTERY RADAR","u_counterbattery","When an enemy fires a shell or rocket at you, a mortar lands on the shooter. Each rank reloads the mortar faster.","BUNKER BUSTER","u_bunker","Shells punch through destructible cover at full damage and splash enemies beside it.","COMBAT ENGINEERS","u_engineers","Stop for 1s and an engineer squad hops off to build a sandbagged MG nest beside you. It takes 4s to build and fires for 15s. One nest at a time; two at rank 2.",
"u_laststand","At 1 armor: +50% fire rate, +30% damage, and every 12 attrition repairs 1 armor (rank 2: +80%, +50%, every 8).","RAILGUN","u_railgun","Main gun fires a hypersonic beam that pierces everything. +1.5 damage, 40% slower reload.","CHAIN REACTION","u_chain","Enemies killed by explosions explode too.","GUNSHIP OVERWATCH","u_gunship","An orbiting gunship drops 105mm rounds on enemies around you (a third faster at rank 2).","FORTRESS MODE","u_fortress","Hold still 1.5s to deploy: +40% fire rate, +1 shell, and a barrier that blocks a hit every 8s.",
"PHOENIX PROTOCOL","u_phoenix","Once per stage, lethal damage instead fully repairs you and detonates a bomb.","THUNDER RUN","u_thunder","+20% speed. At full speed you ram for 4 damage (rank 2: +30% speed, ram for 6).","u_ironclad","+2 max armor and full repair. Rifle and MG rounds bounce back at the shooter.","AVENGER CANNON","u_avenger","A 30mm rotary cannon replaces the main gun. It spins up when you stop: up to 16 rounds a second.","CROCODILE","u_crocodile","Flame projectors ring the hull and burn every enemy inside the ring. Each stack widens it.",
"THERMOBARIC ROUNDS","u_thermobaric","HE blasts are 60% larger and leave burning ground.","MINIGUN CUPOLA","u_minigun","Coax becomes a minigun that fires constantly and shreds incoming fire.","DRONE SWARM","u_swarm","+2 drones, and every drone launches micro-missiles.","CREEPING BARRAGE","u_creeping","Artillery walks a wall of shells ahead of you, and your mines become cluster mines.","BOTTOMLESS RACK","u_bottomless","The rack holds 5. Each racked shot hits 15% harder than the last; kills mid-dump load another round.",
"TUNGSTEN PENETRATOR","u_tungsten","Unlimited pierce, +20% damage per enemy pierced, and shells cross the whole screen.","SIEGE PLOW","u_siegeplow","Rams deal 6 and throw vehicles into others. Cover never slows you.","IRON CURTAIN","u_ironcurtain","Every 5s a dome destroys every incoming projectile nearby and stuns the shooters.","GHOST ARMY","u_ghostarmy","Decoys come in pairs and pop smoke when hit. Enemies that shoot a decoy take +50% damage for 5s.","HIT AND RUN","u_hitandrun","Every kill gives 1s of +40% speed and refunds half the reload.",
